<view class="page mine-page">
  <view class="hero-panel">
    <view class="eyebrow">我的判断记录</view>
    <view class="title">工具、记录和原则</view>
    <view class="subtitle">这里不做接单撮合，只保留你用来判断项目的工具入口、最近查看和避坑原则。</view>
    <view class="metric-grid">
      <view class="metric-item">
        <view class="metric-value">{{stats.projects}}</view>
        <view class="metric-label">项目</view>
      </view>
      <view class="metric-item">
        <view class="metric-value">{{stats.cases}}</view>
        <view class="metric-label">案例</view>
      </view>
      <view class="metric-item">
        <view class="metric-value">{{stats.scans}}</view>
        <view class="metric-label">检测</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">常用工具</view>
  <view class="tool-grid">
    <block wx:for="{{quickTools}}" wx:key="key">
      <view class="tool-card" data-action="{{item.key}}" bindtap="handleQuickTool">
        <view class="tool-title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="muted">{{item.desc}}</view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="section-block" wx:if="{{recentProjects.length}}">
    <view class="section-title">
      <text>最近查看</text>
      <text class="muted" bindtap="clearRecent">清空</text>
    </view>
    <block wx:for="{{recentProjects}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="project-card" data-slug="{{item.slug}}" bindtap="openProject">
        <view class="card-topline">
          <view class="tag plain-tag">{{item.category_text}}</view>
          <view class="risk-pill {{item.risk_class}}">{{item.risk_level_text}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="card-title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="subtitle">{{item.summary}}</view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="panel">
    <view class="section-title">避坑原则</view>
    <block wx:for="{{principles}}" wx:key="*this">
      <view class="list-line">
        <view class="list-index">{{index + 1}}</view>
        <view>{{item}}</view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="panel">
    <view class="section-title">数据与隐私</view>
    <view class="subtitle">案例来自公开机关、法院、平台治理公告或主流媒体，产品优先展示近两年案例，方便持续维护和复核。</view>
    <view class="subtitle">风险检测默认不保存原始文案，只在本机保留最近查看和检测次数。</view>
    <view class="notice">本工具只用于风险识别和低成本验证提醒，不承诺收益，不提供兼职撮合，也不替代法律意见。</view>
  </view>
</view>
